    "body": "[terminat**ing**](https://docs.rs/process_control/3.0.0/process_control/trait.Timeout.html#tymethod.terminating) should be safe. [It's supposed what to be one of the things that sets it apart from other crates.](https://docs.rs/process_control/3.0.0/process_control/index.html#comparable-crates)\r\n\r\nIf you don't want to add `terminating` the crate isn't required for the timeout functionality.\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nlet (sender, receiver) = channel();\r\n\r\nthread::spawn(move|| {\r\n    sender.send(process.output()).unwrap();\r\n});\r\n\r\nreceiver.recv_timeout(duration)\r\n```",
    "created_at": "2021-01-20T18:51:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-21T18:02:07Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/2171#discussion_r561197146",
    "pull_request_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/starship/starship/pulls/2171",
